    v2 = list(map(int, version2.split('.'))

    while len(v1) < len(v2):
        v1.append(0)
    while len(v2) < len(v1):
        v2.append(0)

    for i in range(len(v1)):
        if v1[i] > v2[i]:
            return 1
        elif v1[i] < v2[i]:
            return -1

    return 0
```

This solution first splits the version strings into lists of integers, padding the shorter list with zeros. Then, it iterates through the lists and compares the corresponding elements. If a difference is found, the function returns the appropriate value. If no differences are found, the function returns 0 to indicate equality.

