Here is the recursive function in Java for finding the sum of cubes of each number in a given array:

```java
public static int sumOfCubes(int[] arr, int index) {
  // Base case: when the index reaches the end of the array
  if (index == arr.length) {
    return 0;
  }

  // Recursive case: add the cube of the current number to the sum of cubes of the rest of the array
  int num = arr[index];
  if (num < 0) {
    num = Math.abs(num); // cube the absolute value of the negative number
  }
  int cube = num * num * num;
  int sumOfRest = sumOfCubes(arr, index + 1);

  return cube + sumOfRest;
}

public static int sumOfCubes(int[] arr) {
  return sumOfCubes(arr, 0);
}
