```php
function processTransactions(array $transactions): array {
    $unreconciledIds = [];

    foreach ($transactions as $transaction) {
        if (!$transaction->isReconciled()) {
            $unreconciledIds[] = $transaction->getId();
            $transaction->setReconciled(true); // Mark the transaction as reconciled
        }
    }

    return $unreconciledIds;
}
```

The `processTransactions` function iterates through the array of transaction objects. For each transaction, it checks if the transaction is unreconciled and adds its ID to the `$unreconciledIds` array. It then marks the transaction as reconciled by calling the `setReconciled` method. Finally, it returns the array of unreconciled transaction IDs.

